  "description": {
    "text": "Two boxes first sold at Wal-Mart in Canada in October 2014, then at Rite Aid in the United States, each with two booster packs, a coin and three cosmos holofoil cards found in no booster pack: Venusaur, Charizard and Blastoise, or Dragonite, Garchomp and Hydreigon. They were the cards of the XY Two Pack Blisters of February 2014, printed again; this time Blastoise carried the corrected ©2013 copyright, where the blister copies say ©2012.",
